From e80a54ea0863eef52ca33117cd2484c422dfea39 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Thu, 16 Jul 2026 11:26:56 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] version: Reaper_v1.5.7 (audit fix rung)

Five fixes from the 2026-07-16 multi-agent audit of the Reaper diff, all
adversarially verified before being written:

- webui: System Log no longer hides WLC_SCB_* Broadcom driver errors
- webui: Smart Connect band bitmask indexed by slot, not band count
        (it silently dropped 6 GHz out of the steering group)
- rtrafd: WAN counters from sysfs so the 10 Hz tick stops entering the wl
        driver; live rates scaled by measured interval instead of a
        compile-time constant; flow-table probe, ARP cache, history
        republish, fallback live rows; nf_conntrack_acct restored on stop
- rmcpd: every tool command bounded in time; cleanup armed before the
        early-exit paths that were leaking a live bearer token
- rc/httpd: mangle flush for qos_type=10, port-forward whitespace,
        cfgsync count-check accounting, Reaper_Advisor CSS injection

The version bump is committed BEFORE the build deliberately: the build
script's "clean baseline" step runs `git checkout -- version.conf`, so an
uncommitted bump would be reverted and the images would come out stamped
with the previous rung.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 release/src-rt/version.conf | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/release/src-rt/version.conf b/release/src-rt/version.conf
index 4359f08a4a..7a6a5c0c94 100644
--- a/release/src-rt/version.conf
+++ b/release/src-rt/version.conf
@@ -4,6 +4,6 @@ KERNEL_VER_AM=$(subst .,,$(KERNEL_VER))
 FS_VER_AM=$(subst .,,$(FS_VER))
 
 SERIALNO=102.8
-EXTENDNO=Reaper_v1.5.6
+EXTENDNO=Reaper_v1.5.7
 
 RCNO=0
